   "date": "2013-02-25T16:26:56Z",
   "subject": "Coeficientes parciais de regressão múltipla",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Olá,</font><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">gostaria de saber como obtenho coeficientes parciais padronizados de uma regressão múltipla no R.</font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">library(vegan)</font></div><div><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">height&lt;-c(180,160,150,170,190,172) <br>\r\n\r\nsex&lt;-c(1,2,2,1,1,2) <br>age&lt;-c(40,20,30,40,20,25)</font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">data&lt;-cbind(sex, age)</font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">data.pad&lt;-decostand(data, &quot;standardize&quot;)</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">fit&lt;-lm(height~data.pad)</font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Vi em algumas listas dizendo para usar a função scale para padronizar as variáveis, mas eu já as padronizei pela média na função decostand. </font></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">O que devo fazer? </font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Obrigado desde já</font></p>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">-- <br><font color=\"#666666\">Atenciosamente</font>,<br><b>Diogo Borges Provete</b><br><br>==============================<br>\r\n\r\nBiólogo<br>Mestre em Biologia Animal (UNESP)<br>Doutorando PPG Ecologia e Evolução<br>Laboratório de Ecologia de Insetos (sl. 222)<br></font><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Departamento de Ecologia<br>Instituto de Ciências Biológicas - ICB 1<br>\r\n\r\nUniversidade Federal de Goiás, campus II<br>Goiânia-GO<br>74001-970</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Brazil<br><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Tel. Lab. <a href=\"tel:+55%2062%203521-1732\" value=\"+556235211732\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+55 62 3521-1732</a></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">Cel. +55 </span></b>62 8231-5775</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><br></span></b><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/rLHEaRWZroqHMeh1nw7ZA01HxWH-FTbYOHZ7UKyPsR6-3f9JqUHTJAZqcufBcvRnj29il2iWHfTApTTLvdWBsR0U__IvDeT54-Kx=s0-d-e1-ft#http://download.skype.com/share/emoticons/0142-skype.png\">: diogoprovete<br>\r\n\r\n<br></font><div><div style=\"margin-right:165px\"><b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/diogoprovetepage/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://sites.google.com/site/diogoprovetepage/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244140208000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Rzvz2tGM0vOtNYm7OSwkD\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Personal web page</font></a></b></div></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;margin-right:165px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"text-align:left;margin-right:165px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Editor <a href=\"http://www.herpetologynotes.seh-herpetology.org/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.herpetologynotes.seh-herpetology.org/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244140208000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FQIEh1KShkvKI-iR0VG9V\">Herpetology Notes</a></font></div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"text-align:left;margin-right:165px\"><font face=\"arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">==============================</font></div></div></div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n"
    ]
